// The Inspo desktop app (the Desktop target). The engine it bundles and the
// renderer it serves are built from their own repositories at these paths;
// it reads INSPO_DESKTOP_READ in INSPO_DESKTOP_PROJECT with the person's own
// gcloud sign-in, and opens the page Config/desktop-pages/<INSPO_DESKTOP_PAGE>.json.
//
// WHAT THE APP OPENS (owner, 13 October 2026: "I want to use it from an x code
// build"; the app opens tonight's editor on this Mac). INSPO_DESKTOP_OPENS =
// workspace: the editor's workspace, several engines started together by the
// standing start script and ended by the standing stop script, which the app
// runs as its helper; nothing is bundled (scripts/bundle-engine.sh leaves the
// app's own engine out). Any other word: what the app did before, the one
// engine it bundles, by the words further down. Every word below may also be
// said in the environment of a launch by its own name (a rehearsal on another
// port and state); a value here holds no space but between its words.
INSPO_DESKTOP_OPENS = workspace
// the tool that starts and stops the workspace, and where it keeps a start's state
INSPO_DESKTOP_EDITOR_LOCAL = $(HOME)/Desktop/claude/inspo-context/tools/editor-local
INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_START = $(INSPO_DESKTOP_EDITOR_LOCAL)/open-editor.sh
INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_STOP = $(INSPO_DESKTOP_EDITOR_LOCAL)/stop-workspace.sh
// the port that answers on 127.0.0.1 (the engines take the ports after it), and the start's own name for its state
INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_PORT = 6951
INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_THING = workspace
// the pad's person: an accounts file of ONE made-up person (email, word, key), on this Mac alone, never the rig's
// word. Empty: the start's own sign-in.
INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_ACCOUNTS = $(HOME)/.inspo-pad-account.json
// the pad: where its genes' homes are
INSPO_DESKTOP_PAD = $(HOME)/Desktop/claude/inspo-context/scratch-pad
// what is said after the start's name: the genes it serves, each by its home, a space between two (and the start's
// own last word, if any). The pad's person sees the genes made for that person; a gene of another person's is
// served and not listed for them.
INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_WORDS = $(INSPO_DESKTOP_PAD)/genes/shapes
// what both scripts are told in their environment, in their own words
INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_SAID = EDITOR_LOCAL_WORKSPACE_PORT=$(INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_PORT) EDITOR_LOCAL_WORKSPACE_THING=$(INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_THING) EDITOR_LOCAL_ACCOUNTS=$(INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_ACCOUNTS)
// the file the start keeps the workspace's pid in, and the engines' log it writes
INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_PID = $(INSPO_DESKTOP_EDITOR_LOCAL)/state/$(INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_THING)/pid
INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_LOG = $(INSPO_DESKTOP_EDITOR_LOCAL)/state/$(INSPO_DESKTOP_WORKSPACE_THING)/serve.log
// where each launch's folder of logs is made: <here>/launch-<year>-<month>-<day>-<hour><minute><second>
INSPO_DESKTOP_LOGS = $(HOME)/Library/Logs/Inspo
// A WAY ROUND, NOT A MEND (13 October 2026): the editor's opening does not bring its sign-in in on an arrival that is
// visible from its start (the first frame stays for good), and does once the page has been out of sight for some
// seconds and is shown again. Two numbers: how many seconds after each load of the page the app takes its web view
// out of sight, and for how many seconds (the window says "Opening…" meanwhile, and app.log says each time it is
// done). Measured on this Mac: out of sight from the load for 7 s is too short, for 9 s is enough. Empty: never
// (take it out when the editor's opening is mended).
INSPO_DESKTOP_SHOWN_AGAIN = 0 12
// the window's first size, in points: width, then height (the system keeps the size you then give it)
INSPO_DESKTOP_WINDOW = 1440 900
//
// WHAT THE APP DID BEFORE (INSPO_DESKTOP_OPENS = bundled-engine):
INSPO_DESKTOP_PROJECT = inspo-core
INSPO_DESKTOP_READ = dumps
INSPO_DESKTOP_PAGE = editor
// Developing a gene on this Mac with no cloud (owner, 2026-09-30, thread 18:
// the editor round runs in dev-serve and the desktop app): when
// INSPO_DESKTOP_DEV_GENE names a build-prompt folder, the app runs
// audit dev-serve on it instead of mine-serve, with the Inspo-held gene
// states and the test accounts named here. Empty: mine-serve, as before
// (INSPO_DESKTOP_PAGE = viewer opens the p viewer on dumps).
INSPO_DESKTOP_DEV_GENE = $(HOME)/Desktop/claude/inspo-context/briefs/editor/build-prompt-r1-current
INSPO_DESKTOP_DEV_STATES = $(HOME)/Desktop/claude/inspo-context/runs/editor/dev-states
INSPO_DESKTOP_DEV_ACCOUNTS = $(HOME)/Desktop/claude/inspo-context/briefs/editor/dev-accounts.json
INSPO_DESKTOP_BUNDLE_ID = com.inspoui.desktop
INSPO_AUDIT_RUNNER = $(HOME)/Desktop/GitHub/audit-runner
INSPO_CORE_JS = $(HOME)/Desktop/GitHub/inspo-core-js/inspo-core
